The '''Bingo Pet''' is an All Skills [[Pets|Pet]] which is given upon creating a {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profile. The rarity of this pet is determined by the player's {{BingoText|rank}}. The pet is meant to help with the [[Bingo]] event.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingo Pet''' is automatically granted on {{Gamemode|Bingo}} profiles. The [[Rarity]] of this pet is determined by the player's [[Bingo#Bingo Rank|Bingo Rank]]. It cannot be upgraded by {{NPCSprite|Kat}}, but a {{Item|Tier Boost}} can be used if the player obtains one.

All rarities of this pet require the same amount of XP as a {{Common}} pet to level up.<ref>https://twitter.com/skyerzz/status/1519646552641478657</ref>
