== Trivia ==
* This pet cannot be converted into an item.
* It was the first pet that boosted collection gains, the second one being the [[Black Cat Pet]] with {{Mythic}} rarity.
* It was the first pet that benefits from all skills, the second one being the [[Precursor Drone Pet]].
* It is currently the only pet in the game that is obtained directly by creating a new profile.
* Prior to a hotfix on April 8, 2022, it was possible to get the pet on a non-Bingo profile due to a bug. However, the pet's abilities do not work on non-Bingo profiles, and once it is added to the pet menu, it cannot be taken out. The item is tradeable and auctionable.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5UDdwILvKr0</ref>
* Due to people obtaining the Bingo pet on normal profiles, it is now blacklisted outside of Bingo.
* All rarities of the pet level as if they were common rarity.
* It is one of the only pets whose abilities do not get increased with rarity.
* The {{Mythic}} rarity of this pet is currently only obtainable using a {{Item|Tier Boost}}.
** The first person to obtain a {{Mythic}} Bingo pet was {{Gray|Jeeeegus}}.
** He achieved this during the fourteenth Bingo on January 8th, 2023, with the help of many other Bingo players.

